Package: mica-sftp-server
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: mica build <mica@example.invalid>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: mica SFTP server
 /usr/lib/sftp-server, the program dropbear runs for the sftp subsystem: an
 SFTP version 3 server on stdin and stdout, running as the logged-in user with
 no privilege handling of its own. It serves what OpenSSH's sftp and scp (which
 uses SFTP by default since OpenSSH 9.0) send. The legacy SCP protocol,
 scp -O, is not provided.
 .
 There is no dependency on micad: the binary speaks only SFTP to its SSH server
 and reads nothing micad renders.
 .
 A board feature: boards that offer file transfer select this package; the
 base system does not depend on it.
